{"id":"819cd849f016b0be","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-truth-condition.md","title":"GL Truth Condition","display":"df-gl-truth-condition — GL Truth Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-truth-condition","aliases":["89-df-gl-truth-condition"],"display":"df-gl-truth-condition — GL Truth Condition","depends_on":["[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-truth-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-truth-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-truth-condition — GL Truth Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" href=\"?note=89ed9a6623b0dfc3\" title=\"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl\">89-df-kripke-semantics-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\">\\((W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R,V),v\\models A\">\\((W,R,V),v\\models A\\)</span> is modal satisfaction from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)\\)</span> 是下述定义的三元盒真值谓词，参数依次为模型、世界与公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为系统下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}truth\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ w\\in W\\ \\land\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(wRv\\to(W,R,V),v\\models A\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}truth\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ w\\in W\\ \\land\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(wRv\\to(W,R,V),v\\models A\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词是把一般模态满足关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 子句限制到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\)</span>；它没有引入第二套满足符号。</li>\n<li>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R\">\\(W,R\\)</span> 保留在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\)</span> 的真实签名中，因而不会把\n不同框架上的模型混为一个未参数化的类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-semantics-gl","status":"resolved","id":"89ed9a6623b0dfc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-semantics-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(W,R,V),v\\models A$ is modal satisfaction from\n[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"(W,R,V),v\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}truth\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoxTruth}_{\\mathrm{GL}}((W,R,V),w,A)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)\\ \\land\\ w\\in W\\ \\land\\\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in W\\;\\bigl(wRv\\to(W,R,V),v\\models A\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"W,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLMod}(W,R)","display":false}],"bytes":1343,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-truth-condition]]"}],"outgoing":["9f00301866fbd6f0","89ed9a6623b0dfc3","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}